  "message_id": "SEL_TALK001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 14 01 02 01 01 01}这个嘛……{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}当然{F5 47 02 01 30 01 01 01 05 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:1:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我就想选由加莉{F5 47 02 01 30 01 01 01 05 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}太过分了，别支支吾吾啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}这种时候，就算客套，\n不也该说声“嗯”吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}算了，倒也没关系……\n不过还是有点受打击啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉撅起了嘴……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}真、真的？\n太好了……稍微安心了一点。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 13 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}啊，那个……\n没什么特别的意思哦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:5:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}都牵着手了，要是你却觉得失望，\n那我也会不开心嘛！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉慌了起来……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦？　不，那个……\n不用这么顾虑我啦？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 14 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}你看，我们才刚认识，\n应该还谈不上喜欢还是讨厌吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:7:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}只是觉得，要是被你讨厌，\n会有点受打击，\n而且我也觉得，如果是你……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0062",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 30 01 13 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}不是，没有奇怪的意思！\n只是和顺平他们比起来啦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e200/e210_802.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞由加莉红着脸……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
